# The track mix: GLO held, the keys mute and solo the tracks (latched), whatever page it is on. A tap of
# GLO is still the Global page; a hold with a key is not. Tracks: kick 0, hats 1, snare 2, perc 3, drone 4,
# acid 5, pad 6. Keys: F3 mute kick, F#3 solo kick, G3 hats, A3 snare, C4 perc, D4 drone, F4 acid, G4 pad,
# A4 / A#4 mute / solo all four drums, B4 clear.
wait 3000
expect trkmute 0
expect trksolo 0
# GLO tapped: the Global page, as ever
tap GLO
wait 100
expect view 24
tap HOME
wait 100
# GLO held, F3: the kick muted; the page stays where it was
press GLO
wait 100
tapkey 0
wait 100
shot mix_kick.png
release GLO
wait 100
expect trkmute 1
expect view 0
# held again, G3 and C4: the hats and perc muted too (latched: they stay after letting go)
press GLO
tapkey 2
tapkey 7
release GLO
wait 100
expect trkmute 11
# F3 again: the kick back
press GLO
tapkey 0
release GLO
expect trkmute 10
# solo the pad (G#4)
press GLO
tapkey 15
wait 100
shot mix_solo.png
release GLO
expect trksolo 64
# reset all (E5; the clear key is the pluck's mute now)
press GLO
tapkey 23
release GLO
expect trkmute 0
expect trksolo 0
# all four drums muted (A4), and again: back
press GLO
tapkey 16
release GLO
expect trkmute 15
press GLO
tapkey 16
release GLO
expect trkmute 0
# the keys are still the scale with GLO let go
tapkey 1
expect pool 0x7AD
tapkey 1
# FX menu: the drums' mutes are there too (momentary, G4 = kick), not latched
tap FX
key 14 down
wait 200
expect fxmask 256
expect trkmute 0
key 14 up
tap FX
wait 100
